      ],
      "content": "SP 81 NW 1/40 BIERTON WITH BROUGHTON AYLESBURY ROAD (south side) No. 185 (Formerly listed as Redberry House II House. C18, brick, old tiled roof, brick chimneys to centre, left of centre, and projecting from RH gable. 2 storeys, 1st floor bandcourse, and upper bandcourse on gables. 3 bays of wood casements, 3 light to sides 2 light to centre. 6-panel central door, 2 upper panels glazed, with plain hood. 1 bay wing set back to LH, C19 with diaper patterned brick, 4-light upper casement, arched window to ground floor. Listing NGR: SP8401615650"
